` route returning `FileResponse(index.html)` before the catch-all (partially fixed, needs verification) |\n\n## 5. Active Context\n\n- **Python:** `C:\\Users\\S Nandhakumar\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\Python\\Python312\\python.exe` (3.12.10)\n- **Node.js:** Portable at `C:\\Users\\S Nandhakumar\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\tools\\node-v20.18.0-win-x64\\` (v20.18.0, npm 10.8.2)\n- **No active workspace** set in Antigravity — recommend setting to `C:\\Users\\S Nandhakumar\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\fraudlens-ai`\n- **DB State:** 2479 scored transactions, 2 seeded feedback records in `data/fraudlens.db`\n- **Model State:** Champion=HistGradientBoostingClassifier, tau_low=0.20, tau_high=0.80, test F1=1.000, ROC-AUC=1.000\n- All __init__.py files are missing from package directories (not needed since we use `-m` module execution, but could be added)\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n\n### Critical (Must Fix):\n1. **Verify SPA serving works end-to-end:** The API health endpoint works at `http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health`, but the React SPA at `http://127.0.0.1:8000/` returned empty in the last test. The `@app.get(\"/\")` route was just added but NOT verified. Need to:\n   - Start the server with `run_app.py` (BypassSandbox=true)\n   - curl `http://127.0.0.1:8000/` and confirm HTML response\n   - curl `http://127.0.0.1:8000/assets/index-0V_IabHt.js` to confirm static assets\n   - If still broken, check route ordering (API router prefix `/api` vs catch-all `/{full_path:path}`)\n\n### Recommended:\n2. **Create README.md** with:\n   - Project overview, architecture diagram\n   - Setup instructions (pip install, data generation, model training, frontend build, run)\n   - API documentation summary\n   - Demo walkthrough for judges (3-minute tour: Case A → Case B → Case C)\n   - Screenshots or demo video instructions\n\n3. **Add `__init__.py` files** to `backend/app/`, `backend/app/api/`, `backend/app/core/`, `backend/app/db/`, `backend/app/ml/`, `backend/app/graph/`, `backend/app/sch